WEBVTT

01:26.130 --> 01:31.730
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.320 --> 01:39.539
[Episode 7: Puffer Fish, Please Get into the Trap]

01:40.910 --> 01:45.630
[Liansheng Workshop]

01:54.149 --> 01:56.069
If you keep doing this,

01:56.960 --> 01:58.770
I will run out of patience.

02:18.520 --> 02:20.340
If you like it,

02:21.030 --> 02:22.346
I'll destroy it.

02:22.370 --> 02:24.346
What a spitfire.

02:24.370 --> 02:29.350
That's what I like about you.

02:30.080 --> 02:31.966
It doesn't matter, just do it.

02:31.990 --> 02:34.390
I'll be more excited.

02:40.750 --> 02:42.200
Sister.

02:46.300 --> 02:48.116
Miss Ke, stop messing around.

02:48.140 --> 02:49.616
Put down the hairpin.

02:49.640 --> 02:51.090
Sister.

02:51.870 --> 02:53.320
Put it down.

02:55.030 --> 02:56.630
Put it down, good girl.

03:12.710 --> 03:17.140
One, two, three.

03:19.080 --> 03:23.040
I'll give you 30 taels of silver.

03:23.310 --> 03:25.416
It's said that the beauty is intoxicating.

03:25.440 --> 03:27.246
I almost forgot today's business，

03:27.270 --> 03:29.390
but he comes to me now.

03:46.270 --> 03:47.496
Take Tian Hu away.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.756
Don't drag me down.

03:48.780 --> 03:50.156
Jin.

03:50.180 --> 03:51.630
Leave.

03:52.320 --> 03:53.596
Jin, be careful.

03:53.620 --> 03:55.070
Let's go.

04:04.150 --> 04:05.526
Mei Zhu.

04:05.550 --> 04:06.756
What are you waiting for?

04:06.780 --> 04:08.340
Kick his ass!

04:21.090 --> 04:23.610
Come on, together.

05:06.980 --> 05:08.430
He

05:08.780 --> 05:11.720
is the best swordsman in Yangzhou.

05:12.180 --> 05:15.260
He does live up to his reputation.

05:16.160 --> 05:17.846
Cut the crap.

05:17.870 --> 05:20.510
How about making it quick?

05:21.030 --> 05:22.590
Do it together.

05:48.390 --> 05:49.796
Are you okay, girl?

05:49.820 --> 05:51.270
I'm fine.

05:51.340 --> 05:52.346
I can handle it.

05:52.370 --> 05:53.136
I don't need your help.

05:53.160 --> 05:54.610
Cut the crap.

05:55.590 --> 05:56.775
You're here too.

05:56.799 --> 05:58.370
Such a party.

06:07.590 --> 06:08.856
Poison

06:08.880 --> 06:10.360
won't work on me.

06:13.820 --> 06:15.446
This girl is a spitfire.

06:15.470 --> 06:17.116
I need her alive,

06:17.140 --> 06:18.196
so don't kill her.

06:18.220 --> 06:20.920
And as for this drunkard...

08:40.470 --> 08:41.990
Didn't I ask you to leave?

08:50.660 --> 08:52.386
We have no argument with you.

08:52.410 --> 08:53.950
Why did you pick a fight?

08:54.970 --> 08:56.850
I've investigated you.

08:56.990 --> 08:59.000
Shu Yanan, right?

08:59.620 --> 09:02.340
Your father died because you brought bad luck to him,

09:02.370 --> 09:05.096
and your godfather died for the same reason.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.976
You came in a hurry today

09:07.000 --> 09:09.030
to accompany them in hell?

09:11.340 --> 09:14.640
Back then, the things about Shu's escort bureau and godfather...

09:16.180 --> 09:17.446
Qi Tianfeng and you are accomplices.

09:17.470 --> 09:19.390
Him?

09:19.540 --> 09:21.276
Qi Tianfeng doesn't deserve it!

09:21.300 --> 09:22.386
What?

09:22.410 --> 09:24.886
Is his face whiter than your butt?

09:24.910 --> 09:26.456
Listen,

09:26.480 --> 09:28.026
I dare to kill Wen Cong,

09:28.050 --> 09:28.946
becuse I have someone behind me

09:28.970 --> 09:32.380
who you can't even imagine.

09:33.510 --> 09:34.606
Girl,

09:34.630 --> 09:36.850
he's provoking you. Don't fall for it.

09:37.810 --> 09:39.286
You two,

09:39.310 --> 09:41.706
what are you waiting for with these vulgar men?

09:41.730 --> 09:43.180
Keep fighting!

10:25.900 --> 10:27.350
You're injured,

10:28.220 --> 10:29.670
leave it to me.

10:35.150 --> 10:36.600
Don't worry.

10:50.160 --> 10:51.926
This guy is very skilled,

10:51.950 --> 10:53.400
probably a master.

10:53.830 --> 10:54.936
Jin,

10:54.960 --> 10:56.186
you drank too much today,

10:56.210 --> 10:57.680
you are not her competition.

10:59.500 --> 11:00.950
Step back.

11:19.380 --> 11:21.830
Are you bluffing?

11:22.310 --> 11:23.810
Do it again.

11:24.640 --> 11:26.086
Just shut up,

11:26.110 --> 11:27.560
go together.

11:32.410 --> 11:33.860
Ten.

11:36.990 --> 11:38.440
Nine.

11:40.540 --> 11:42.780
I didn't expect him to be so skillful.

11:43.340 --> 11:44.790
Eight.

11:53.580 --> 11:55.030
Seven.

12:06.870 --> 12:08.320
Six.

12:20.300 --> 12:21.750
Five.

12:28.070 --> 12:29.520
Four.

12:39.190 --> 12:40.640
Three.

12:47.110 --> 12:48.560
Two.

12:52.950 --> 12:54.400
One.

13:21.780 --> 13:23.230
Tang Xiao,

13:23.790 --> 13:26.420
I know there must be someone behind you.

13:32.760 --> 13:34.290
I won't kill you today,

13:34.440 --> 13:36.340
but let the master behind you show up.

13:36.640 --> 13:38.090
I want to meet him.

13:38.930 --> 13:40.380
Get lost!

14:25.630 --> 14:27.080
Boss.

14:29.990 --> 14:31.580
Are you...

14:33.870 --> 14:36.050
Are you exhaust internal strength?

14:39.150 --> 14:40.446
He doesn't have any internal strength,

14:40.470 --> 14:42.020
he's terrified.

15:01.460 --> 15:02.816
Let's go find him. That's right

15:02.840 --> 15:03.846
It's so expensive.

15:03.870 --> 15:05.350
Tell us.

15:05.470 --> 15:06.846
One tael of silver could buy

15:06.870 --> 15:08.110
four catties first-class silk before.

15:08.110 --> 15:08.870
Yeah.

15:08.870 --> 15:11.350
Now, we have to pay one and a half taels of silver for one catty.

15:11.420 --> 15:13.116
How many times have you doubled it?

15:13.140 --> 15:15.806
Right, right? right!

15:15.830 --> 15:17.630
Everyone.

15:17.860 --> 15:18.956
I'm sorry.

15:18.980 --> 15:19.786
If you think it's too expensive,

15:19.810 --> 15:22.046
please go somewhere else to take a chance.

15:22.070 --> 15:24.040
How could you say that?

15:24.830 --> 15:26.470
You are losing sight of clients!

15:26.470 --> 15:27.470
Yes, indeed!

15:27.470 --> 15:29.110
Excuse me.

15:30.950 --> 15:32.740
One and a half taels of silver for one catty.

15:33.710 --> 15:34.846
Boss,

15:34.870 --> 15:36.910
please give me fifty catties.

15:37.760 --> 15:39.870
Got it, wait a moment, please.

15:40.060 --> 15:41.940
Buying it at such a price is so...

15:42.310 --> 15:44.670
How could you let him raise the price?

15:45.000 --> 15:46.706
There was a fire in Yufeng warehouse

15:46.730 --> 15:48.786
and burned half amount of raw silk in Nandu City.

15:48.810 --> 15:51.860
There's some silk, why not buy them?

15:52.570 --> 15:53.436
Indeed.

15:53.460 --> 15:55.506
Boss, give me fifty catties.

15:55.530 --> 15:58.000
Me too. Me too.

16:09.980 --> 16:11.430
Mr Ding.

16:14.900 --> 16:17.876
Now all we need is to wait for other merchants to come.

16:17.900 --> 16:19.286
Before the market is closed today,

16:19.310 --> 16:21.350
double the silk price.

16:21.700 --> 16:23.150
Understood.

16:24.960 --> 16:28.090
You're intelligent and good at business.

16:28.250 --> 16:30.256
You sold 30% amount of land to me

16:30.280 --> 16:32.570
and charged me 15,000 taels of silver.

16:35.920 --> 16:39.300
What are you looking at? Afraid of getting short measure?

16:39.390 --> 16:40.286
Don't worry.

16:40.310 --> 16:43.130
I can't be bothered to do something as petty as this.

16:48.820 --> 16:51.430
You could have sent someone

16:52.740 --> 16:55.030
for the 15,000 taels of silver.

16:55.450 --> 16:57.650
Why did you come here yourself?

16:59.180 --> 17:01.296
There must be something else.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.770
Yes.

17:04.229 --> 17:06.490
I have something to ask.

17:07.219 --> 17:10.110
Wen Cong's adopted daughter is Shu Yanan.

17:10.110 --> 17:12.170
I think you already knew it.

17:14.880 --> 17:16.820
Are your two masters

17:16.840 --> 17:19.126
no match for that girl?

17:19.150 --> 17:21.109
She's nothing.

17:21.749 --> 17:25.450
But you didn't mention that Yun Xiang is an extraordinary master.

17:25.469 --> 17:27.830
What do you mean? Think I'm a joke?

17:28.730 --> 17:30.270
Yun Xiang.

17:33.070 --> 17:34.600
It seems that

17:35.270 --> 17:39.730
your cheating trick that was claimed to be invincible

17:39.940 --> 17:42.370
met a match.

17:42.730 --> 17:43.986
Cheating trick?

17:44.010 --> 17:45.256
How is that cheating trick?

17:45.280 --> 17:48.956
I can see that he's skilled

17:48.980 --> 17:50.046
and experienced.

17:50.070 --> 17:51.716
He's not an ordinary master.

17:51.740 --> 17:52.726
Yes.

17:52.750 --> 17:54.910
My men fought him before.

17:55.220 --> 17:56.626
Although he's skilled,

17:56.650 --> 18:00.470
I heard that he only defended but didn't attack.

18:00.640 --> 18:02.090
Really?

18:02.270 --> 18:05.230
And he didn't want to fight but ended it quickly.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.850
Is that so?

18:06.930 --> 18:07.996
Yes.

18:08.020 --> 18:09.266
What do you mean?

18:09.290 --> 18:10.980
He doesn't know how to fight.

18:22.630 --> 18:23.976
Mr Qi,

18:24.000 --> 18:26.080
you had him here.

18:28.950 --> 18:30.870
You are the famous Invincible Fist in Nandu City.

18:30.870 --> 18:32.470
Don't waste it.

18:32.550 --> 18:33.806
Kill him for me.

18:33.830 --> 18:36.010
Take it as a gift for this deal.

18:52.260 --> 18:55.126
♫ There are thousands of barriers in Yumen Mountain ♫

18:55.150 --> 18:58.856
♫ There's always war in the mountain ♫

18:58.880 --> 19:01.800
♫ We must watch the fire ♫

19:01.820 --> 19:05.076
♫ The horse goes deep into the mountain and disappears ♫

19:05.100 --> 19:11.510
♫ Spring and the rain are in our hearts ♫

19:13.800 --> 19:17.076
♫ Lock our hearts ♫

19:17.100 --> 19:20.386
♫ There're wrinkles on my forehead ♫

19:20.410 --> 19:23.736
♫ I was so anxious ♫

19:23.760 --> 19:27.016
♫ I was afraid the wind would blow away my fate ♫

19:27.040 --> 19:30.456
♫ People come and go ♫

19:30.480 --> 19:33.826
♫ Turn around once in a lifetime ♫

19:33.850 --> 19:36.760
♫ From now on, my heart ♫

19:36.780 --> 19:41.260
♫ Don't allow anyone to ask ♫

20:01.420 --> 20:04.200
Are you wondering why did you lose last night?

20:05.280 --> 20:07.446
That woman is invincible.

20:07.470 --> 20:09.070
I didn't know her weakness at that time.

20:11.400 --> 20:13.000
The softest

20:13.370 --> 20:15.490
can beat the hardest.

20:16.770 --> 20:17.956
Sometimes, the best way

20:17.980 --> 20:18.730
is not to go head-to-head.

20:18.750 --> 20:20.186
I didn't lose.

20:20.210 --> 20:21.870
I just haven't won yet.

20:33.830 --> 20:34.550
Rubbing shoulders with me,

20:34.550 --> 20:36.120
do you really take me as your brother?

20:36.690 --> 20:38.436
If you don't reduce dislocation correctly,

20:38.460 --> 20:40.440
there will be an endless relapse.

20:41.990 --> 20:43.440
I'll do it myself.

20:43.500 --> 20:44.776
Hey, trust me.

20:44.800 --> 20:46.326
I know a lot of

20:46.350 --> 20:47.820
injuries like this.

20:49.180 --> 20:50.630
Trust me.

20:51.430 --> 20:52.880
I mean it.

21:06.800 --> 21:08.366
Her timing was wrong.

21:08.390 --> 21:09.746
She was blocked by Zhong,

21:09.770 --> 21:12.066
and then she was hit on the back by Mei Zhu.

21:12.090 --> 21:13.086
She got a dislocation of her left shoulder.

21:13.110 --> 21:14.446
I hit him in the same position too.

21:14.470 --> 21:15.920
It's not easy for him.

21:17.390 --> 21:17.886
Here.

21:17.910 --> 21:19.360
The back.

21:21.550 --> 21:23.000
I'm gonna do it.

21:24.350 --> 21:31.200
[Liansheng Workshop]

21:32.650 --> 21:34.530
It hurts.

21:38.070 --> 21:40.036
Do you want to die?

21:40.060 --> 21:40.766
No.

21:40.790 --> 21:42.236
Look at you now, so strong!

21:42.260 --> 21:44.030
Is it because I'm good at it?

22:02.870 --> 22:04.320
You're cranky.

22:05.060 --> 22:06.780
Only I can live with it.

22:13.940 --> 22:15.390
After taking this elixir,

22:15.570 --> 22:19.020
your internal strength will be recovered within two days.

22:21.360 --> 22:22.930
This is the secret elixir in my clan.

22:23.470 --> 22:24.886
You still don't trust me?

22:24.910 --> 22:26.450
Then you don't trust yourself.

22:33.430 --> 22:35.026
Fooling me with syrup.

22:35.050 --> 22:36.866
This elixir is extremely bitter.

22:36.890 --> 22:38.740
I added honey in it.

22:48.870 --> 22:50.706
If you have ointment for blood circulation,

22:50.730 --> 22:52.180
you should put some on it.

22:54.390 --> 22:55.840
Well.

22:56.400 --> 22:57.826
It's a gift from you,

22:57.850 --> 22:59.340
I'll keep it for a few more days.

23:02.670 --> 23:03.726
That's just great.

23:03.750 --> 23:06.860
Everyone knows my wife is a spitfire.

23:07.780 --> 23:09.230
You...

23:13.590 --> 23:15.150
What is the elixir?

23:16.030 --> 23:18.656
Do you feel there's anything else uncomfortable

23:18.680 --> 23:20.130
except for the weakness?

23:23.500 --> 23:24.726
That's good.

23:24.750 --> 23:26.356
I didn't tell you earlier.

23:26.380 --> 23:27.806
After taking this elixir,

23:27.830 --> 23:29.486
your meridians will be locked

23:29.510 --> 23:31.180
and your internal strength will be dispersed.

23:32.030 --> 23:33.026
For how long?

23:33.050 --> 23:33.790
I told you,

23:33.810 --> 23:35.390
you'll recover in two days.

23:36.220 --> 23:38.300
I really want to kill you.

23:38.620 --> 23:40.600
Can you handle Tang Xiao by yourself if he comes?

23:42.050 --> 23:43.586
No matter how powerful Tang Xiao is,

23:43.610 --> 23:45.450
he has to fear the law.

23:46.110 --> 23:47.446
If he succeeded last night,

23:47.470 --> 23:49.666
he would have deceived the whole world and destroyed the evidence.

23:49.690 --> 23:51.610
But now that his plan is exposed,

23:51.770 --> 23:53.560
he won't ask for trouble.

23:54.110 --> 23:55.620
You know everything.

23:55.800 --> 23:58.180
Tell me who is the one behind Tang Xiao?

24:00.310 --> 24:01.940
Here, sit.

24:07.630 --> 24:09.080
Okay.

24:09.760 --> 24:11.210
Let me ask you first.

24:12.390 --> 24:14.810
Were you the one

24:15.910 --> 24:17.360
who followed Mo Bufan and me yesterday?

24:21.270 --> 24:23.300
And the scar on your left shoulder

24:23.580 --> 24:27.240
was from an injury Kang Qiao inflicted on you with a stone, right?

24:33.910 --> 24:35.510
You fooled me to take the elixir,

24:35.890 --> 24:37.590
because you were afraid that I'd hurt you.

24:37.620 --> 24:39.270
I was helping you with your wound.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.846
Yanan,

24:41.870 --> 24:43.330
answer me honestly.

24:43.430 --> 24:44.880
Why did you do that?

24:49.510 --> 24:50.660
You are ambiguous

24:50.680 --> 24:52.026
and unrealistic.

24:52.050 --> 24:54.310
I wasn't sure about the situation so I wanted to figure it out.

25:15.750 --> 25:17.200
That's all.

25:23.790 --> 25:25.670
I tried my best to win Mo Bufan over.

25:25.910 --> 25:27.356
I just wanted to work with him

25:27.380 --> 25:28.830
to deal with Qi Tianfeng.

25:28.900 --> 25:31.290
But you hurt his people at the crucial moment.

25:31.390 --> 25:32.816
If he gets suspicious,

25:32.840 --> 25:35.090
my chance of winning will be less.

25:35.190 --> 25:36.596
You should have told me earlier.

25:36.620 --> 25:38.630
Haven't I told you enough?

25:41.560 --> 25:43.326
But what you asked me to do is over the line.

25:43.350 --> 25:46.540
I didn't know what you want to do.

25:49.900 --> 25:51.800
You must hide it well.

25:53.260 --> 25:55.350
You'd better hide it until it's forgotten and

25:55.660 --> 25:57.600
impossible to be exposed again.

25:57.790 --> 25:59.236
If I were killed yesterday,

25:59.260 --> 26:01.760
wouldn't it be safer for me to disappear with the secret?

26:07.510 --> 26:09.280
How could I not save you?

26:15.900 --> 26:17.750
I've plotted so much this time.

26:18.090 --> 26:20.400
The show is about to start.

26:21.670 --> 26:23.120
You,

26:23.470 --> 26:25.340
don't make any more trouble.

26:29.480 --> 26:30.930
Do you hear me?

26:57.700 --> 26:59.150
Jin,

27:00.720 --> 27:02.940
I'll pay fifty taels of silver for Tang Xiao's head.

27:05.280 --> 27:07.190
Are you insulting me on purpose?

27:07.350 --> 27:08.980
If it was that easy,

27:09.160 --> 27:11.000
was from an injury Kang Qiao inflicted on you with a stone, right?

27:13.350 --> 27:14.870
Then we work together.

27:16.950 --> 27:18.760
He provoked us,

27:18.940 --> 27:21.140
I can barely sleep without revenge.

27:22.430 --> 27:24.430
With your kung fu,

27:25.040 --> 27:26.980
what can you do even if there are ten more like you?

27:30.000 --> 27:31.450
Stop sharpening.

27:31.800 --> 27:33.326
I knew I was late.

27:33.350 --> 27:35.760
You didn't dare to draw your knife but now mock me instead.

27:36.100 --> 27:38.046
They say you're a hero,

27:38.070 --> 27:39.840
it turns out you just bully the weak and fear the strong.

27:42.830 --> 27:44.410
You sound tough.

27:45.130 --> 27:46.810
Do you mind a fight?

27:47.590 --> 27:49.040
Sure.

27:49.130 --> 27:51.056
I told you that you're not flexible.

27:51.080 --> 27:52.040
I'll let you know

27:52.060 --> 27:53.550
how unstable your lower body is.

27:57.670 --> 27:59.160
Why did you make a sneak attack?

27:59.920 --> 28:01.760
How could you ask such a question?

28:02.190 --> 28:04.540
Your martial arts skills are really promising.

28:15.110 --> 28:16.560
Enough.

28:21.030 --> 28:23.990
That's what your strength is used for.

28:26.890 --> 28:28.396
It's just a competition,

28:28.420 --> 28:30.140
why did you hit him so hard?

28:32.790 --> 28:34.240
Let's go.

28:47.990 --> 28:49.440
Jin.

28:52.390 --> 28:54.086
Thanks for saving our lives.

28:54.110 --> 28:55.766
Thank you for my sister.

28:55.790 --> 28:56.526
Tian Hu.

28:56.550 --> 28:57.326
What are you doing?

28:57.350 --> 28:58.800
Get up.

28:58.870 --> 29:00.556
Last night, my sister told me

29:00.580 --> 29:02.756
that you said you love money,

29:02.780 --> 29:04.876
but you risked your life for us when we were in danger.

29:04.900 --> 29:06.450
You are a true master.

29:07.090 --> 29:09.470
She was in a hurry just now.

29:09.550 --> 29:11.510
Please forgive her.

29:11.670 --> 29:14.260
She got angry with me for Su Mingyu.

29:14.390 --> 29:15.966
I don't know who risked his life yesterday.

29:15.990 --> 29:16.946
She knows it clearly.

29:16.970 --> 29:18.660
Why are you kneeling again? Get up.

29:19.350 --> 29:20.726
I...

29:20.750 --> 29:22.540
I don't want to kneel,

29:22.990 --> 29:24.600
but there's no other way to thank you.

29:25.650 --> 29:27.780
It's good that you know what I mean.

29:29.620 --> 29:31.070
Forget it.

29:38.900 --> 29:42.130
Don't worry. It's just a minor injury.

29:44.410 --> 29:46.166
I couldn't be there yesterday.

29:46.190 --> 29:48.110
I felt so regretful.

29:49.160 --> 29:51.450
That's why I spoke harshly to Jin.

29:54.340 --> 29:56.620
He was drunk yesterday,

29:56.710 --> 29:58.350
so he didn't win.

29:58.830 --> 30:00.590
You even add fuel to the fire.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.980
He should have hit you harder.

30:07.190 --> 30:09.260
You didn't say that just now.

30:18.830 --> 30:20.440
Why do falling flowers pine for love?

30:21.430 --> 30:23.040
Why is flowing water heartless?

30:23.820 --> 30:25.290
I don't know about that.

30:26.730 --> 30:27.736
I only know

30:27.760 --> 30:29.990
I'm always thinking about you.

30:30.630 --> 30:32.830
I don't know what day it is.

30:44.830 --> 30:48.510
Your uniform is old.

30:48.990 --> 30:51.820
I'll make you a new one.

30:54.630 --> 30:56.100
I like the old one too.

30:56.690 --> 30:58.086
If you give me a new one,

30:58.110 --> 31:00.276
I'll keep this

31:00.300 --> 31:01.750
and preserve it.

31:05.310 --> 31:07.890
Yesterday, Tang Xiao

31:08.110 --> 31:10.030
didn't seem to come at me,

31:10.220 --> 31:12.796
but at Jin and Miss Shu.

31:12.820 --> 31:14.270
Them?

31:17.710 --> 31:19.710
So they're coming at Mr Yun?

31:20.050 --> 31:21.736
I wonder

31:21.760 --> 31:24.290
what boss Yun thinks of the arson case.

31:35.300 --> 31:37.286
If, as you said, the arsonist wasn't Tang Xiao,

31:37.310 --> 31:38.216
who could it be?

31:38.240 --> 31:40.700
I suspect this is their first move.

31:40.950 --> 31:41.846
By the way,

31:41.870 --> 31:43.870
what does President Su think of this matter?

31:45.440 --> 31:46.990
She didn't say much.

31:48.950 --> 31:51.196
Your sister has been the President of the Chamber of Commerce for many years.

31:51.220 --> 31:52.950
She is not an ordinary woman.

31:53.310 --> 31:54.806
Since you don't want to tell me,

31:54.830 --> 31:56.426
listen to me

31:56.450 --> 31:58.360
and check with her words.

31:58.630 --> 32:01.086
Maybe today, tomorrow at the latest,

32:01.110 --> 32:03.140
the business community of Nandu City will be in chaos.

32:03.610 --> 32:06.606
As the century-old silk merchant,

32:06.630 --> 32:07.466
your family should take the lead,

32:07.490 --> 32:09.880
and you will be involved in this turmoil.

32:10.350 --> 32:11.996
Nothing is going on now.

32:12.020 --> 32:13.470
How can I trust you?

32:15.430 --> 32:16.880
Where are we going?

32:17.130 --> 32:18.506
Although you don't want to go into business,

32:18.530 --> 32:19.990
but you are not stupid.

32:20.070 --> 32:22.030
Let's take a look first.

32:23.340 --> 32:25.536
It's completely sold out.

32:25.560 --> 32:26.826
It's hoarding and speculation.

32:26.850 --> 32:28.326
Why would I lie to you?

32:28.350 --> 32:29.046
I'll offer a high price.

32:29.070 --> 32:31.430
How about two taels of silver for one catty?

32:32.120 --> 32:33.770
Two taels of silver for one catty raw silk.

32:34.110 --> 32:35.566
I've never heard of it.

32:35.590 --> 32:36.766
This is just the beginning.

32:36.790 --> 32:38.400
You can check it in a few days.

32:40.770 --> 32:41.596
It's Mr Su.

32:41.620 --> 32:43.070
Let's go.

32:43.430 --> 32:44.880
Go.

32:45.540 --> 32:47.220
Mr Su, Mr Su.

32:47.240 --> 32:48.766
Mr Su, don't run!

32:48.790 --> 32:50.046
Hurry!

32:50.070 --> 32:51.216
Run!

32:51.240 --> 32:53.680
Mr Su! Mr Su!

32:53.890 --> 32:55.830
Wait, Mr Su.

33:07.810 --> 33:09.076
It's horrible.

33:09.100 --> 33:10.610
How did this happen?

33:12.350 --> 33:14.030
Do you trust me now?

33:14.150 --> 33:16.750
So, raising the silk price is the second move.

33:16.790 --> 33:19.320
The person who set fire is the one behind all the things.

33:20.800 --> 33:23.406
You're intelligent, that's true.

33:23.430 --> 33:24.286
But there are so many merchants,

33:24.310 --> 33:26.386
who is the one?

33:26.410 --> 33:28.270
I'm afraid it's impossible to tell.

33:33.670 --> 33:36.190
[Juxing Tea House]

33:34.270 --> 33:35.556
Normally,

33:35.580 --> 33:39.156
One catty raw silk costs three or four qian of silver.

33:39.180 --> 33:39.950
But now

33:39.970 --> 33:42.190
it costs two taels and six of silver.

33:42.470 --> 33:44.880
It may increase by three taels of silver before the market is closed.

33:49.820 --> 33:51.016
Your guess

33:51.040 --> 33:53.680
is not much different from what Miss Su said.

33:54.250 --> 33:56.430
Uncle Qian, you didn't see that.

33:57.570 --> 33:58.776
I was surrounded by

33:58.800 --> 34:01.010
most of the silk merchants in Nandu City.

34:01.100 --> 34:02.666
They must think we are short of silk,

34:02.690 --> 34:04.780
and we have to accept the price.

34:06.280 --> 34:08.070
You will turn cloth over to the imperial court,

34:08.910 --> 34:11.269
it's reasonable to buy silk at a high price.

34:11.410 --> 34:15.360
Be in charge of the Chamber of Commerce,

34:15.390 --> 34:17.410
your family don't lower silk price,

34:17.580 --> 34:18.835
but take part in raising it.

34:18.859 --> 34:19.795
That's impossible.

34:19.819 --> 34:21.335
If my sister disturbs the silk market,

34:21.359 --> 34:22.596
she will be convicted by the government.

34:22.620 --> 34:23.936
In this way,

34:23.960 --> 34:26.110
they get what they want.

34:28.270 --> 34:29.850
Did I prove their rumors

34:30.140 --> 34:31.686
in the silk shop earlier?

34:31.710 --> 34:33.229
If not you,

34:33.339 --> 34:34.466
there will be someone else

34:34.490 --> 34:36.999
who buy the silk at a high price by your name.

34:38.379 --> 34:39.686
Mr Yun,

34:39.710 --> 34:43.350
you seem to know this very well.

34:46.010 --> 34:47.886
It's just a little trick.

34:47.910 --> 34:50.350
So sister is going to Yangzhou

34:50.460 --> 34:51.996
to purchase a large amount of raw silk,

34:52.020 --> 34:53.660
and also lower the silk price.

34:53.790 --> 34:54.896
Uncle Qian.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.156
When will the caravan depart?

34:56.180 --> 34:57.766
Tonight.

34:57.790 --> 35:00.366
I've arranged the roads and waterways.

35:00.390 --> 35:01.816
Butler Qian,

35:01.840 --> 35:03.880
I'm afraid we won't be able to use the wateaway.

35:05.170 --> 35:07.290
Do you want to go to the Water Gang again?

35:07.500 --> 35:09.646
Don't you remember when we came back from Yangzhou last time,

35:09.670 --> 35:12.620
the robbers went straight to the raw silk.

35:13.360 --> 35:15.950
Who were they after?

35:16.070 --> 35:19.260
I think you know it.

35:28.200 --> 35:29.976
If the waterway doesn't work,

35:30.000 --> 35:32.126
the roads will take three more days.

35:32.150 --> 35:35.190
The soldiers and bandits must be dangerous along the way.

35:35.580 --> 35:36.206
Uncle Qian.

35:36.230 --> 35:37.800
I must go this time.

35:38.540 --> 35:39.636
No.

35:39.660 --> 35:41.110
Uncle Qian.

35:41.890 --> 35:44.096
Miss Su has made up her mind.

35:44.120 --> 35:45.680
Stop arguing.

35:48.620 --> 35:50.046
Mr Yun,

35:50.070 --> 35:51.576
Miss Su said,

35:51.600 --> 35:52.516
she hopes

35:52.540 --> 35:55.080
you can be a friend of our family.

35:55.300 --> 35:56.756
I didn't know what it means.

35:56.780 --> 36:00.040
But today, I really understand.

36:29.060 --> 36:30.186
Yun Xiang,

36:30.210 --> 36:31.670
you're right.

36:31.710 --> 36:34.320
I'm afraid that my family will be in trouble.

36:35.050 --> 36:37.780
If you can help us get through this,

36:38.170 --> 36:40.566
I will repay you

36:40.590 --> 36:41.906
with gratitude.

36:41.930 --> 36:43.820
We met by chance.

36:44.350 --> 36:47.780
We had many misunderstandings, but treated each other with sincerity in the end.

36:48.150 --> 36:49.526
If the Su family is in danger,

36:49.550 --> 36:51.460
I will definitely help.

36:51.890 --> 36:53.706
But President Su and Boss Qian

36:53.730 --> 36:55.726
don't seem to have trusted me yet.

36:55.750 --> 36:57.536
This is why I hate business.

36:57.560 --> 36:58.546
They've run a business for a long time,

36:58.570 --> 37:00.660
so they don't trust anyone.

37:06.790 --> 37:08.240
Yun Xiang.

37:10.150 --> 37:11.600
I trust you.

37:13.920 --> 37:15.370
Great.

37:15.570 --> 37:17.050
Since you trust me,

37:17.150 --> 37:19.636
you can't go to transport raw silk.

37:19.660 --> 37:22.470
I will need you in the future.

37:27.880 --> 37:29.866
Your brother hasn't come back.

37:29.890 --> 37:31.400
Why are you looking for me?

37:31.470 --> 37:32.996
Mr Jin, did you forget?

37:33.020 --> 37:35.096
Mr Su and you were eating in our restaurant that day.

37:35.120 --> 37:36.960
You asked my brother to pack up the leftover

37:36.980 --> 37:38.700
and send it to a place.

37:39.750 --> 37:40.646
Yes.

37:40.670 --> 37:41.766
Hasn't he come back yet?

37:41.790 --> 37:42.956
No.

37:42.980 --> 37:44.690
It's been 3 days, Mr Jin...

37:44.710 --> 37:45.806
Don't worry.

37:45.830 --> 37:47.156
I'll go check it out.

37:47.180 --> 37:49.046
I'll let you know tomorrow morning.

37:49.070 --> 37:50.186
Thank you, Mr Jin.

37:50.210 --> 37:51.660
Thanks a lot!

38:11.940 --> 38:12.866
Girl,

38:12.890 --> 38:13.746
do you know how to read the ledger?

38:13.770 --> 38:14.786
Check the ledger.

38:14.810 --> 38:16.260
Miss Ke can handle it.

38:16.420 --> 38:17.666
Why am I looking for her?

38:17.690 --> 38:19.220
Come with me.

38:20.150 --> 38:21.850
I'll buy you a drink later.

38:31.930 --> 38:33.336
What ledger do you want to check?

38:33.360 --> 38:35.800
You'll know when we get there.

38:52.710 --> 38:53.746
Master Jin.

38:53.770 --> 38:55.220
Jia.

38:56.080 --> 38:57.486
Please, come in.

38:57.510 --> 38:58.636
Madam.

38:58.660 --> 39:00.120
Master Jin is here.

39:02.150 --> 39:03.600
Master Jin.

39:04.900 --> 39:06.886
Did kids like the desserts

39:06.910 --> 39:08.590
sent the day before yesterday?

39:08.930 --> 39:10.016
They loved it.

39:10.040 --> 39:11.456
Thank you, Master Jin.

39:11.480 --> 39:13.270
It was not enough for them,

39:13.270 --> 39:15.900
so I made something similar at night.

39:16.790 --> 39:19.010
After the young man sent the desserts,

39:19.190 --> 39:20.800
did he leave directly?

39:24.570 --> 39:26.966
He wanted some money at first.

39:26.990 --> 39:29.586
And then he saw that we did it for the kids,

39:29.610 --> 39:32.280
so he left directly.

39:32.350 --> 39:34.340
You entrusted kids here?

39:34.850 --> 39:36.246
You don't know about it.

39:36.270 --> 39:37.146
Master Jin

39:37.170 --> 39:39.976
has been sponsoring us for more than two years.

39:40.000 --> 39:43.050
He's the most generous donor in our Jishantang.

39:43.150 --> 39:44.616
Yes, yes.

39:44.640 --> 39:47.410
Are they asleep?

39:47.870 --> 39:49.006
Not yet.

39:49.030 --> 39:50.646
Go and bring them out.

39:50.670 --> 39:52.920
OK, please wait a moment.

40:02.990 --> 40:05.236
Master Jin, you don't know about it.

40:05.260 --> 40:07.456
These kids are very naughty.

40:07.480 --> 40:09.136
I'm afraid he can't do it alone.

40:09.160 --> 40:11.236
I'll go take a look. Have a seat.

40:11.260 --> 40:12.710
Thank you.

40:34.270 --> 40:36.070
How is it? Have they arrived?

40:36.640 --> 40:37.446
I sent a signal.

40:37.470 --> 40:38.540
They should be here soon.

40:38.560 --> 40:39.406
Have you paid enough money?

40:39.430 --> 40:40.010
Of course.

40:40.030 --> 40:40.596
We can't

40:40.620 --> 40:42.560
beat Jin Shiliang.

40:55.850 --> 40:57.966
There should be three people.

40:57.990 --> 41:00.150
do you know how to read the ledger?

41:00.320 --> 41:01.376
All have arrived.

41:01.400 --> 41:03.150
There is one more woman.

41:07.650 --> 41:09.366
No need to waste the money.

41:09.390 --> 41:10.926
That woman is weak.

41:10.950 --> 41:12.400
I can handle it.

41:19.920 --> 41:21.370
Girl!

41:33.410 --> 41:35.276
Your own kid is here?

41:35.300 --> 41:37.610
Take the kid back and we'll take care of him.

41:37.830 --> 41:39.280
What are you talking about?

41:39.620 --> 41:42.526
If the swordsmen in Jiangnan get into trouble,

41:42.550 --> 41:43.986
and their families can't raise the orphans,

41:44.010 --> 41:45.530
they will send them here.

41:46.070 --> 41:47.846
You're already in danger.

41:47.870 --> 41:49.286
How can you care about others?

41:49.310 --> 41:51.936
Shut up. Just check the ledger.

41:51.960 --> 41:53.736
Tell me, is this ledger correct?

41:53.760 --> 41:55.940
I know it's not correct without checking it.

41:56.720 --> 41:58.170
Why?

41:58.380 --> 42:00.846
Those two have taken care of over 20 kids.

42:00.870 --> 42:02.376
They must have tons of housework to do.

42:02.400 --> 42:04.290
But I just saw their hands.

42:04.370 --> 42:05.850
They are not rough at all.

42:07.900 --> 42:10.670
No wonder I feel something is wrong.

42:13.900 --> 42:15.350
Let's go.

42:15.480 --> 42:16.446
Come with me.

42:16.470 --> 42:17.920
No.

42:18.070 --> 42:19.886
Yun Xiang fooled me to take an elixir.

42:19.910 --> 42:21.796
My meridians are locked and my internal strength is weak.

42:21.820 --> 42:23.330
I'll be a burden to you.

42:23.490 --> 42:24.286
This guy!

42:24.310 --> 42:25.960
Is there anyone he doesn't fool with?

42:26.970 --> 42:28.086
Stay here.

42:28.110 --> 42:29.336
By the way,

42:29.360 --> 42:31.740
if anyone comes out, keep him alive.

42:59.040 --> 43:00.490
Jia Chang'an.
